# ─── Replicant · mobile PWA (apps/mobile) ──────────────────────────
#
# Copy to .env.local. Every var is optional; without them the mobile
# app runs guest-only against the local Go backend.

# ─── API target ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# URL the browser hits for REST + SSE. Leave empty in local dev so
# env.ts defaults to localhost:8080; set in prod.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN=https://api.replicant.example.com

# ─── Clerk (optional — sign-in CTA on mobile) ──────────────────────
# When both keys are present the home page exposes a SIGN IN button
# and REST calls carry the user's Clerk JWT. Without them mobile
# runs guest-only (deviceId auth) — which is the intended default
# for a party game.
#
# Keys should match the host app (same Clerk application).

# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
